      "stem": "What does the woman offer to do?",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "Sell the man an umbrella."
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "Lend the man her umbrella."
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "Drive the man to his house."
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "A：明确no need买，不是出售；B：you can borrow mine明确借伞；C：未提出开车送回家"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "stem": "What will the woman do?",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "Visit without a guided tour."
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "Cancel her visit to the gallery."
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "Book a place on the full tour."
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "A：末句明确自行参观；B：没有取消参观，只不参加导览；C：已满组未订到，也无需订自行参观"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "stem": "What is the man doing?",
