          "Taking notes during a public lecture."
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "Recording material for a programme."
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "A：要求重录并剪辑，不是批改书面作业；B：已在控制录音采访，不只是听公开讲座记笔记；C：clean recording与edit programme共同支持录制节目素材"
    },
    {
