      "stem": "What does the man suggest?",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "Choosing the cheaper camera despite its bag."
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "Paying extra for a camera with a new bag."
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "Giving up photography until prices fall."
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "A：相机运作好，不为包的划痕多付一倍价，A准确；B：明确不为包更整洁多付；C：没有建议放弃摄影或等待降价"
    },
